This directory exists only to satisfy Vercel.

Vercel builds this project as a static site with serverless functions attached,
so it requires a static output directory and fails the deploy with "No Output
Directory named 'public' found" when one is missing. This API serves everything
through api/index.js — there is no static output — so the directory is empty on
purpose.

Do not put anything routable here. Vercel checks the filesystem before applying
the rewrite in vercel.json, so a file placed here would shadow the matching API
route rather than reaching Express.
